OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 29 MAR
OL,4,G1300FGuy Garvey's Finest Hour
OL,5,     GGuy looks back at the Manchester
OL,6,     Gmusic scene of the late 90s and
OL,7,     Gearly 2000s, which revolved
OL,8,     Garound the chippy-turned-music
OL,9,     Gvenue the Night and Day Cafe.
OL,10,G1600FIggy Pop
OL,11,     GIggy serves up his last sonic
OL,12,     Gcocktail of 2026 including loads
OL,13,     Gof show favourites. Expect key
OL,14,     Gcuts by the likes of Sleaford
OL,15,     GMods, Mediaeval Baebes, Albert
OL,16,     GAyler, Miles and more.
OL,17,G1800FMary Anne Hobbs
OL,18,     GMary Anne wishes Iggy happy
OL,19,     Gtrails, as he takes a gap-year at
OL,20,     G6 Music. Plus some music from
OL,21,     Gthis weekend's 6 Music Festival.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
